 "description": "Per track, every trig's velocity gets a random offset of up to +-N, clamped to 1..127. N is one of 16 steps (0 to 64), set with FUNC + the VEL knob on the TRIG page, where the knob becomes a sixteen-position selector and the label reads RND. Stored with the pattern, in core-ar2's mod storage. Port of rytm-mods 0003-velocity-humanise. From 1.2 FUNC + VEL's turn and text go through core-ar2 0.4's page tables (needs core 0.4, OS 1.74 only).",
